Image Studio combines two projects, released here under the MIT License:

- codejunkie99/image-loop (commit 77a1b78): image-loop, image-edit-map,
  image-reconstruction, image-inspiration (was "inspiration"),
  image-reverse-engineer (was "reverse-engineer"), prompts/, examples/,
  scripts/install.py, tests/test_loop.py, tests/test_inspiration.py.
  The prompt-lab collection stays in that repository.
- hbui290/image-processing-skill (v1.4.1, commit a9f1a2f, plus audit fixes d5aea6a;
  superseded by this repository):
  image-inspect, image-create, image-repair, image-verify and their references,
  audit_candidate.py, tests/test_audit_candidate.py. Its standalone SKILL.md now
  lives in image-inspect/references/diagnosis.md, image-verify/references/acceptance.md,
  and the "Control generated edits" section of repair-and-composite.md.

New in Image Studio: contract_to_brief.py, review.py --report, the
image-reviewer agent, audit support for the image-loop report format and
coordinate-based repair prompts, Claude Code and Codex plugin manifests,
tests/test_bridge.py, tests/test_package.py, tests/test_regressions.py, tests/deps.py,
image-verify/references/decisions.md and independent-review.md.

New in 2.2.0: the image-enhance skill (SKILL.md, scripts/compare_display.py,
references/recipes.md), tests/test_enhance.py, tests/test_fix_*.py, examples/image-repair/.

New in 2.2.1: tests/test_visual_map.py, tests/test_hooks.py, the repository's
CLAUDE.md and .claude/ hooks, and the anonymized tavern before/after images in
examples/image-repair/tavern-hero/.

New in 2.14.0: the "When a generated result misses the request" table in
image-inspect/references/diagnosis.md and the wording rules in
image-create/references/prompt-blocks.md are adapted from
codejunkie99/image-loop prompt-lab/image-prompting-guide-v2.md (commit 77a1b78).


New in 2.20.0: review and hunt rules adapted from MIT-licensed projects:
wanshuiyin/ALIGN-Agentic-Loop-Image-GeneratioN (fresh-context reviewer, proof of
looking, three-state follow-up of earlier findings, fixed views), scenario-labs/skills
(per-panel judging, per-reference leak check, letter-by-letter label reading),
chchchadzilla/slop-cop (verbatim text transcription, copy that contradicts a chart;
in 2.21 the crop-check ratios and the twice-the-display size rule),
jiahuiqu17/paper-signal (aspect-ratio tolerance), and 42cc-hub/comfyui-agent-suite
(masked edit-check thresholds, seam measurement). Each is MIT licensed; only ideas
and rules were adapted, no code was copied. Ideas from repositories without a
license (aimolodca/Frame-Patcher: registration check before compositing, adaptive
feather; aeolo-ai/aeolo-image-fidelity: CIEDE2000 color limits;
Melvin-88/manhwa-recap: arm tracing) were reimplemented from their descriptions.

New in 2.21.0: the text wrapping and shrink-to-fit (binary search of the font size) in
image-create/scripts/compose_layers.py are adapted from scenario-labs/skills
(skills/scenario-text-overlay/scripts/pillow_render.py), MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Scenario Inc.
